    "aliases": "FreeOD Wiki wording variants of a canonical effect: same effect, different Chinese phrasing (强化 vs 增强, 分离 vs 断离). Hand-checked one by one against the vocab label they alias. Only orthographic/wording variants belong here — a mapping that needs semantic inference is left out, because the English UI showing nothing beats it showing the wrong effect.",
